, or 5%. Franchise revenue consisted of franchise royalty fees of $63.9 million, franchise territory fees of $9.4 million, technology fees of $6.6 million and training fees of $5.2 million in the six months ended June 30, 2026, compared to franchise royalty fees of $66.2 million, franchise territory fees of $8.1 million, technology fees of $8.8 million and training fees of $6.1 million in the six months ended June 30, 2025. The decrease in franchise royalty fees was primarily due to a decrease in same store sales coupled with a decrease due to brand divestitures in 2025. The increase in franchise territory fees is primarily attributed to an increase of $1.6 million in revenue recognized as a result of franchise agreement terminations year-over-year to $3.0 million in the six months ended June 30, 2026, compared to $1.4 million in the prior year period.","context":"Total revenue. Total revenue was $126.7 million in the six months ended June 30, 2026, compared to $153.1 million in the six months ended June 30, 2025, a decrease of $26.4 million, or 17%. The decrease in total revenue was primarily due to a decrease in equipment revenue due to a decrease in equipment installations and a decrease in merchandise revenue.","section":"The following is a discussion of our consolidated results of operations for the six months ended June 30, 2026 versus the six months ended June 30, 2025.","block":552,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001802156-26-000095","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-07","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001802156","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1802156/000180215626000095/xpof-20260630.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/ea9e7107ef0f995cddc856f11954c4ae9dd00570ef14c323bb02c437d0220eac.bin","sha256":"ea9e7107ef0f995cddc856f11954c4ae9dd00570ef14c323bb02c437d0220eac"}},{"id":"4e552bf0365dea381a17581a861712a6d78037edc019b37e8eb7b952a344d34e","quote":"Franchise 